<title>USA: One Price Clothing Q1 sales $78.9 million.</title>
<headline>One Price Clothing Q1 sales $78.9 million.</headline>
<dateline>DUNCAN, S.C. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>One Price Clothing Stores Inc said on Tuesday that its first-quarter sales were $78.9 million, up from $76.3 million in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said same-store sales for the quarter were up four percent, and chainwide average store sales increased 10 percent, from the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>One Price said it will release its full financial results during the week ending May 31.</p>
</text>
